                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I got this game after really enjoying Pinko Park and had to drop it despite the short playtime.\r\nI admit it’s mostly a me thing, but I didn’t enjoy playing it at all. It felt like a casual tablet game with bad controls. I’m not sure if it’s a Steam Deck issue or if the objects were so small that it wasn’t registering but I had to struggle just to finish two patients in a row. The flies especially were extremely annoying because hitting them was always pure luck.\r\nThe biggest issue was me getting the ick from some of the symptoms, which I admit is not objective but I’d rather not force myself to go through something however mildly unpleasant.",
